      "canonical_latex": "\\xi(t) = -A_x \\cos(\\omega_p t + \\phi),\\quad \\eta(t) = k A_x \\sin(\\omega_p t + \\phi),\\quad \\zeta(t) = A_z \\sin(\\omega_p t + \\phi + m\\frac{\\pi}{2}),\\quad A_x = \\gamma_k A_z",
